    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiosk Simulator is an action-packed comedic take on the hustles of running a big city kiosk and the nostalgia of reaching that lone open kiosk on a rainy late night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/cabd2c4a98930a5b7ad861c10ee549e2.poster.avif?t=1753817247\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/cabd2c4a98930a5b7ad861c10ee549e2.webm?t=1753817247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/cabd2c4a98930a5b7ad861c10ee549e2.mp4?t=1753817247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roleplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a kiosk\u2019s owner in Cologne, Germany.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restock, serve customers, maintain and protect your kiosk against robbery and vandalism!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vibrant Cast and Dynamic Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each customer could be a loyal customer, a potential shoplifter or even a troublemaker!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty Curve</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tougher antagonists/bosses might take away your hard-earned cash - so be prepared for a challenge!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/d90b6dde75e477761a65e83880603d18.poster.avif?t=1753817247\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/d90b6dde75e477761a65e83880603d18.webm?t=1753817247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/d90b6dde75e477761a65e83880603d18.mp4?t=1753817247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restock the Kiosk with better products</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade to new furniture and better security</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kiosk Simulator is an action-packed comedic take on the hustles of running a big city kiosk and the nostalgia of reaching that lone open kiosk on a rainy late night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/cabd2c4a98930a5b7ad861c10ee549e2.poster.avif?t=1753817247\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/cabd2c4a98930a5b7ad861c10ee549e2.webm?t=1753817247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/cabd2c4a98930a5b7ad861c10ee549e2.mp4?t=1753817247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roleplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a kiosk\u2019s owner in Cologne, Germany.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restock, serve customers, maintain and protect your kiosk against robbery and vandalism!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vibrant Cast and Dynamic Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each customer could be a loyal customer, a potential shoplifter or even a troublemaker!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty Curve</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tougher antagonists/bosses might take away your hard-earned cash - so be prepared for a challenge!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/d90b6dde75e477761a65e83880603d18.poster.avif?t=1753817247\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/d90b6dde75e477761a65e83880603d18.webm?t=1753817247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727430/extras/d90b6dde75e477761a65e83880603d18.mp4?t=1753817247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restock the Kiosk with better products</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade to new furniture and better security</p></li></ul>",
